{"2026940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Happy Trap House", "steam_appid": 2026940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026940/extras/e38c1159b6a4c2add43feb6f0bec6a10.poster.avif?t=1770839146\" width=617 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026940/extras/e38c1159b6a4c2add43feb6f0bec6a10.webm?t=1770839146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026940/extras/84abc772e56c418fe5ad894997270933.avif?t=1770839146\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun 3D roguelike trap runner where you, as a toy zombie, must rescue your zombie friends from a house. But be warned, the house is full of deadly dangers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no saving in this game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a paraglider, jetpack or ride a Pegasus to explore the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get celebrated in the leaderboard if you manage to free all the zombies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you do, can you do it in one run?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026940/extras/292150d4b9a31fa29f01431cb454dfd0.poster.avif?t=1770839146\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store